<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets warrants on Swire Pacific.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrants on Swire Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Tuesday it has launched 50 million American-style call warrants on shares of Swire Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$63.00     PREMIUM	 12.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.4280    GEARING	 4.8X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  28.MAY.98    MIN EXER LOT  5,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$68.50     GOVERNING LAW HONG KONG</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  SETTLEMENT IN &quot;A&quot; SHARES OF SWIRE PACIFIC LTD</p>
<p>			 WITH CASH ALTERNATIVE AT DISCRETION OF</p>
<p>			 ISSUER.</p>
<p>			 SETTLEMENT DATE APPROXIMATELY THREE WEEKS</p>
<p>			 AFTER ISSUE DATE</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
